"WINARM (P0 D3): a few suites below are guarded by `Smalltalk platformName`
 (prim 266). They are not skipped for tidiness — on Windows their FFI
 pragmas cannot resolve until sprint P5 (MIGRATION.md §3.5), the failure
 raises a guest error, and an unhandled guest error ABORTS the process
 until sprint P2 lands the recovery layer. One unrunnable assertion would
 therefore take the whole suite's report with it.

 Guarded here rather than by dropping the files from tests.list, because
 the files LOAD fine everywhere — only running them touches FFI — and
 because the test classes must stay declared for these very lines to
 compile. Written as a condition rather than deleted on one platform so
 MACVM and WINARM keep sharing this file verbatim.

 Two different conditions, deliberately: `~~ #windows` marks a POSIX
 dependency (a Linux host would run it), `== #macos` marks something only
 macOS has at all -- Accelerate.framework and the Objective-C runtime."
Smalltalk platformName ~~ #windows ifTrue: [ TestRunner run: FFIAlienTests ].
TestRunner run: NilMacroTests.
TestRunner run: NumberExtTests.
TestRunner run: CollectionExtTests.
TestRunner run: StringStreamExtTests.
TestRunner run: ObjectExtTests.
TestRunner run: IterationExtTests.
TestRunner run: DictPointSetExtTests.
TestRunner run: FormatIterExtTests.
TestRunner run: FinalExtTests.
TestRunner run: NumberCoercionTests.
TestRunner run: ReflectionTests.
TestRunner run: CurtailmentTests.
TestRunner run: RopeTests.
TestRunner run: EditorSessionTests.
Smalltalk platformName ~~ #windows ifTrue: [ TestRunner run: PosixIoTests ].
TestRunner run: IoStreamTests.
TestRunner run: ScaledDecimalTests.
Smalltalk platformName ~~ #windows ifTrue: [ TestRunner run: SocketTests ].
Smalltalk platformName == #macos ifTrue: [ TestRunner run: AccelTests ].
TestRunner run: SupervisorTests.
TestRunner run: ExceptionTests.
TestRunner run: CollectionCompletionTests.
TestRunner run: NumericCompletionTests.
Smalltalk platformName ~~ #windows ifTrue: [ TestRunner run: ClockCompletionTests ].
TestRunner run: ExceptionVerbTests.
TestRunner run: VmErrorTests.
Smalltalk platformName == #macos ifTrue: [ TestRunner run: CocoaStringTests ].
TestRunner run: StringCompletionTests.
TestRunner run: ObjectStreamTests.
TestRunner run: ExceptionResumeTests.
TestRunner report.
